### A decision's memo, and a Proposal's two buttons.

memo-options = Options
memo-recommended = recommended
memo-other = Other: I'll write the answer
memo-other-placeholder = Your answer, as it will go in the comment
memo-confirm = Decide: { $choice }
memo-confirm-none = Choose an option
memo-confirm-change = Change to: { $choice }
memo-confirm-same = Already decided: { $choice }
memo-already = You already decided { $choice }. If you change it, I write a new comment that replaces the first.
memo-deferred = You deferred it: it stays for the next dailies. You can decide now too.
memo-proof-open = Open the file
memo-will-write = What it will write
memo-will-comment = a signed comment "Decision: { $choice }"
memo-will-comment-again = a new signed comment "Decision: { $choice }"
memo-will-restart = the task restarts with this choice (state { $state })
memo-will-close = the task closes (state { $state })
memo-will-nothing = Nothing, until you choose.
memo-waiting = arrived { $when }
memo-irreversible = Irreversible: it goes outside. No option is preselected and silence doesn't decide.
memo-context = What this is about
memo-fact = Done so far
memo-gaps = What only you know
memo-criterion = Criterion
memo-advice = Recommendation
memo-advice-none = No recommendation: the choice is yours.
memo-why-toggle = Add your reason (optional)
memo-why-placeholder = It goes in the comment and helps the next step
memo-proofs = Evidence
memo-silence-label = If you don't answer:
memo-silence-hold = I stay put.
memo-defer = Defer
memo-discuss = Let's discuss
proposal-approve = Approve
proposal-discard = Discard
session-road-A = Open the session with me, in a chat
session-road-B = Answer the first three gaps here
